    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "But let me ask you this, as you go home and as your colleagues go home, you're very good at messaging and selling this, you had Elizabeth Warren come out yesterday and say single payer is the only thing that works. You had Cory Booker and John Lewis with their little stunt on the Capitol steps on their Facebook live thing. They're very good at selling how terrible this is and how this is going to kill hundreds of millions of people. This is going to be like the walking dead is going to be America after the Republican health care bill. How do you sell the virtue of what this bill does? And how do you answer the expected talking points of Republicans are trying to kill people? This is going to cut Medicaid and all of that nonsense.",
