        "text": "Competition in markets leads to lower prices and better services.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The promise that premiums would not increase—and would decrease—under Obamacare was false.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The claim that individuals could keep their doctors and healthcare plans under Obamacare was false.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Obamacare has caused premiums in Wisconsin to double since its enactment.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "People in rural areas often have only one healthcare provider option.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Many rural counties lack healthcare providers entirely.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Obamacare is currently failing or 'imploding' in rural areas.",
